{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designated Driver Simulator: Become the True Hero of the Streets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designated Driver Simulator</strong> is an open-world game set in a bustling city where you take on the role of a designated driver. Meet diverse passengers, take them safely to their destinations, and earn money along the way! Your goal is to pay a set amount of money to your demanding boss each week. Fail, and your contract is terminated, ending the game. But if you succeed, greater upgrades and new opportunities await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>An Adventure Through the City\u2019s Nightlife</strong><br>Navigate a sprawling open-world city and encounter a wide range of passengers. From impatient office workers to intoxicated artists, each customer presents unique demands that will test your judgment. Satisfy your passengers to earn more tips and rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/b5e2086315d296b36235091dcb6a5513.poster.avif?t=1770466302\" width=800 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/b5e2086315d296b36235091dcb6a5513.webm?t=1770466302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/b5e2086315d296b36235091dcb6a5513.mp4?t=1770466302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Vehicle Upgrades &amp; Customization</strong><br>Spend your hard-earned cash to purchase new vehicles or upgrade your existing ride. Customizing your car\u2019s appearance not only adds personality but also enhances performance for faster and safer drives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/4da5ac2accc54c51910ccdf989a71924.poster.avif?t=1770466302\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/4da5ac2accc54c51910ccdf989a71924.webm?t=1770466302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/4da5ac2accc54c51910ccdf989a71924.mp4?t=1770466302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>Sharpen Your Skills for Greater Success</strong><br>Train at various academies throughout the city to improve your driving and communication skills. Masterful driving and excellent customer service are key to becoming the ultimate designated driver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/3f7879b33a15ee1392d7b0340a4f07b4.poster.avif?t=1770466302\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/3f7879b33a15ee1392d7b0340a4f07b4.webm?t=1770466302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/3f7879b33a15ee1392d7b0340a4f07b4.mp4?t=1770466302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude21 <strong>Survive the Grueling Weekly Payments</strong><br>Your relentless boss expects a set payment every week. The journey won\u2019t be easy, but don\u2019t lose hope. Only persistence and wisdom will lead you to success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/3d56a086b87aefd59a6cf1f86cd6cfcb.poster.avif?t=1770466302\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/3d56a086b87aefd59a6cf1f86cd6cfcb.webm?t=1770466302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/3d56a086b87aefd59a6cf1f86cd6cfcb.mp4?t=1770466302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can become the true hero of the streets. Start your journey in <strong>Designated Driver Simulator</strong> now!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Surviving the First Night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1813640/84b4e275619242b32b2048a3052ee6efa9734c55.jpg"},{"name":"Bittersweet Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1813640/ffe88f98e9f4eb080dc8a081eff9b33a49282dcf.jpg"},{"name":"The Boss's Right Hand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1813640/cc121d7b7bcf693f867884e8e3d3f6d75a0e1565.jpg"},{"name":"In Search of Freedom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1813640/228568f828431155224a4f2a413c0cc776878a34.jpg"},{"name":"Is the Water Cold?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1813640/680a0e4ab96ac3e70bd4bdc29a14b6734a685c64.jpg"},{"name":"Five Stars!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1813640/9b74044e43d68f3ce5118d14e7ee2575b79606a2.jpg"},{"name":"Zero-Accident Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1813640/dbe69324fa831102c21a6c01951a720c6b5c543b.jpg"},{"name":"Big Earner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1813640/2199644b081f23f135df9a664b3d63499def961e.jpg"},{"name":"Bullet Driver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1813640/88fe407242e46c4d3e4675b0cf406af95aad1de2.jpg"},{"name":"I Trusted You, Boss!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1813640/0357af613bd1296b43a9ab73d59f574a918c6ec9.jpg"}],"total":29},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1813640?t=1770466302","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/b288068fad761bc54eea9d4c3533ccd378cb3987/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770466302","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/77c65651c29c14f57ff5affb71522a0661b99baf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770466302","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/77c65651c29c14f57ff5affb71522a0661b99baf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770466302","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designated Driver Simulator: Become the True Hero of the Streets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designated Driver Simulator</strong> is an open-world game set in a bustling city where you take on the role of a designated driver. Meet diverse passengers, take them safely to their destinations, and earn money along the way! Your goal is to pay a set amount of money to your demanding boss each week. Fail, and your contract is terminated, ending the game. But if you succeed, greater upgrades and new opportunities await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>An Adventure Through the City\u2019s Nightlife</strong><br>Navigate a sprawling open-world city and encounter a wide range of passengers. From impatient office workers to intoxicated artists, each customer presents unique demands that will test your judgment. Satisfy your passengers to earn more tips and rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/b5e2086315d296b36235091dcb6a5513.poster.avif?t=1770466302\" width=800 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/b5e2086315d296b36235091dcb6a5513.webm?t=1770466302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/b5e2086315d296b36235091dcb6a5513.mp4?t=1770466302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Vehicle Upgrades &amp; Customization</strong><br>Spend your hard-earned cash to purchase new vehicles or upgrade your existing ride. Customizing your car\u2019s appearance not only adds personality but also enhances performance for faster and safer drives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813640/extras/4da5ac2accc5